# The dashboard build (frontend/) is a static site (see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md).
# api/index.py additionally deploys src/api.py as a real Vercel serverless
# function (only /api/upload is meant to work live there -- see its docstring)
# so /src/ and /db/ (schema.sql) must stay included, unlike earlier revisions
# of this file.
#
# Every pattern is anchored to the repo root (leading "/") -- an unanchored
# pattern like "data/" matches ANY directory with that name at ANY depth,
# which previously also matched (and deleted) frontend/public/data/, breaking
# the dashboard build.
/data/
/r_analysis/
/vba/
/tests/
/scripts/
/benchmarks/
/docs/
/requirements.txt
/pytest.ini
/.venv/
